		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3622F47EE2F048E9"]
			description: ["The &6Calutron&r bends a beam of ions in a magnet, and each isotope lands in its own cup. The first prize is &6calcium-48&r, rare in nature and the bullet of every superheavy run."]
